+The digest domain of the managed-identity write-protection observation is `proofrail:agent-runner-policy-write-guard:2\n` (domain version `:2`); the observed vector is always the four fixed slots `[policy directory | parent directory | artifact | anchor]`, an absent slot is written as the canonical empty marker `∅`, and the slot order and count do not vary with which objects exist, so digests from different domain versions are never compared as equal.
 
